  "notes": "Adds AO3-safe CSS export cleanup and editable CSS round-tripping. Export removes AO3-rejected gap, clip-path, grid-template-rows, repeat(...) grid-template-columns, and grid-auto declarations, replaces required-tag layout with a simple AO3-safe flex layout, and simplifies the unsupported multi-layer category-multi background. Exported CSS includes a Skin Studio edit-state comment so it can be pasted back in and fully restored for editing. Older/external CSS can also be imported, preserved per skin as custom CSS, and common colors are imported where recognizable."
